<view class="page">
    <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">当前调试站点</text>
        <view class="proxy-card">
            <text class="debug-tag">{{debugSite.stage}} · 调试期</text>
            <text class="debug-url">{{debugSite.url}}</text>
            <text class="field-hint">域名与 HTTPS 反代已就位，ICP 备案仍在进行。调试期可用，正式发布前需完成下列步骤。</text>
            <view class="proxy-actions">
                <button class="ghost-button" size="mini" bindtap="handleRestoreDebugSite">恢复默认站点</button>
                <button class="primary-button" size="mini" bindtap="handleCopyLegalDomain">复制登记值</button>
            </view>
        </view>
        <view class="note-card">
            <text class="note-text">上线待办：</text>
            <text class="debug-list" wx:for="{{debugChecklist}}" wx:key="*this">{{index + 1}}. {{item}}</text>
            <text class="note-text">腾讯云免费 CA 证书已部署，预览面板与开发者工具可直接连上站点，不需要抓取代理。真机与正式版仍需等 ICP 备案通过后登记 request 合法域名；调试期可在开发者工具勾选「不校验合法域名、TLS 版本以及 HTTPS 证书」。</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">抓取代理 · 可选兜底（http / IP / 自签站点）</text>
        <view class="proxy-card">
            <text class="proxy-error" wx:if="{{proxyError !== ''}}">{{proxyError}}</text>
            <text class="field-label">代理地址</text>
            <input
                class="field-input"
                placeholder="https://proxy.example.com/fetch"
                value="{{proxyTemplate}}"
                bindinput="handleProxyTemplateInput"
                maxlength="300"
            />
            <text class="field-hint">留空为直连。填写后小程序只请求该 https 地址，目标站点 URL 会自动以 url 参数附加；也支持在地址里用占位符自定义参数位置。</text>
            <text class="field-label proxy-second-label">访问令牌（可选）</text>
            <input
                class="field-input"
                placeholder="与服务端 PROXY_TOKEN 一致"
                value="{{proxyToken}}"
                bindinput="handleProxyTokenInput"
                maxlength="80"
            />
            <view class="proxy-actions">
                <button class="ghost-button" size="mini" bindtap="handleClearProxy">关闭代理</button>
                <button class="primary-button" size="mini" bindtap="handleSaveProxy">保存</button>
            </view>
        </view>
        <view class="note-card">
            <text class="note-text">本站点已装 CA 证书，留空即直连。此功能仅供 http 明文、裸 IP、自签证书等无法直连的站点使用：由服务端抓取 HTML 回传，代理域名本身仍需加入 request 合法域名。</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">检测</text>
        <view class="cell">
            <view class="cell-main">
                <text class="cell-label">请求超时</text>
                <text class="cell-desc">体检与浏览共用该超时时间</text>
            </view>
            <picker range="{{timeoutLabels}}" value="{{timeoutIndex}}" bindchange="handleTimeoutChange">
                <view class="picker-value">
                    <text>{{timeoutLabels[timeoutIndex]}}</text>
                    <text class="picker-arrow">›</text>
                </view>
            </picker>
        </view>
        <view class="cell" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="handleClearCache">
            <view class="cell-main">
                <text class="cell-label">清除检测缓存</text>
                <text class="cell-desc">当前缓存 {{statusCacheCount}} 条状态记录</text>
            </view>
            <text class="cell-action">清除</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">数据</text>
        <view class="cell" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="handleClearAll">
            <view class="cell-main">
                <text class="cell-label cell-label-danger">清空全部站点</text>
                <text class="cell-desc">本机已保存 {{siteCount}} 个站点，数据仅存于本机</text>
            </view>
            <text class="cell-action cell-action-danger">清空</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">关于</text>
        <view class="cell cell-static">
            <view class="cell-main">
                <text class="cell-label">站点坞 v1.0.0</text>
                <text class="cell-desc">自建站点的管理与原生浏览入口</text>
            </view>
        </view>
        <view class="note-card">
            <text class="note-text">说明：正式发布后，小程序只能请求后台已配置的合法域名。体验与调试阶段可在开发者工具中勾选「不校验合法域名」。浏览页将站点页面解析为原生界面渲染，纯脚本渲染的站点可能提取不到正文。</text>
        </view>
    </view>
</view>
